### Update Reproductive Status - Pregnant
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPregnant": true,
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-09-01",
  "averageCycleLength": 28
}

### Update Reproductive Status - Not Pregnant (with pregnancy end date)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPregnant": false,
  "pregnancyEndDate": "2025-10-01",
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-10-15",
  "averageCycleLength": 30
}

### Get Period Tracker Data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-tracker
